Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Teto 每日一词！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,生菜！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我最近在减肥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以打算开始吃沙拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,祝我好运吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别吃沙拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在厕所蹲了整整三天！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉就像奥本海默的鬼魂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,跑到我肚子里搞了场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的核试验！
